      "blocks": [
        {
          "components": [
            {
              "type": "richText",
              "html": "\r\n<img src=\"/challenge/images/v2/36/yarn_calculator.png\">\r\nEstimate how much yarn you will need for your garment by using the calculator below.<br>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Knit and dress your swatch</li>\r\n<li>Measure the ENTIRE swatch width and length</li>\r\n<li>Weigh the swatch in grams</li>\r\n<li>Enter your data in the calculator</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n",
